\newlabel{fig:fig4c3}{{3.4}{46}{Probability density of a free-particle wave packet at four different times (in units where $\hbar =m=1$). The center of the packet (purple triangles) moves at the classical velocity $p/m$, while the packet spreads out}{figure.caption.15}{}}
